      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Hecarim cleaves nearby enemies dealing physical damage. If Hecarim damages at least one enemy, he increases the damage and lowers the cooldown of subsequent Rampages.",
      "summary_zh": "赫卡里姆猛劈周围的敌人，同时造成物理伤害。如果这个技能对至少一名敌人造成伤害，那么赫卡里姆会提升【暴走】的伤害并为随后施放的【暴走】缩短冷却时间。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307379:3989863"
      ]
