      "summary_en": "Hecarim gains increasing Move Speed and can move through units for a short duration. His next attack knocks the target back and deals additional physical damage based on the distance he has traveled since activating the ability.",
      "summary_zh": "赫卡里姆获得不断提升的移动速度加成并且移动时可以无视单位的碰撞体积。他的下一次攻击将会击退目标，并且造成额外物理伤害，伤害值基于他在激活该技能后所移动的距离。",
